                        <cell>Per cent of duty.</cell>
                        <cell>Per cent of duty actually paid on cost at United States
                            seaboard.</cell>
                    </row>
                    <row>
                        <cell>White pine No. 7 (65 per cent comes from Canada)</cell>
                        <cell role="num">$30.00</cell>
