                <p><hi rendition="#superscript">1</hi> $41.80 per 1,000 feet.</p>
                <p><hi rendition="#superscript">2</hi> $46.45 per 1,000 feet.</p>
                <p><hi rendition="#superscript">3</hi> $92.90 per 1,000 feet.</p>
